      "narrative": "* Upriver, Northeast Region, Washington DNR. Started on private land one mile east of Spokane, WA. Timber. Active fire behavior with running, torching and uphill runs. Numerous residences threatened. Area, road and trail closures in effect. * Old Emigrant, Pendleton Unit, Oregon DOF. Six miles southeast of Pendleton, OR. Grass and brush. Active fire behavior with running, wind-driven runs and flanking. Residences threatened. Evacuations in effect. Tule Rd, Yakama Agency, BIA. CIMT (NW Team 2). Five miles south of Toppenish, WA. Grass and brush. Moderate fire behavior with creeping, smoldering and wind-driven runs. Juniper Dunes, Spokane District, BLM. Ten miles northeast of Pasco, WA. Grass and brush. Active fire behavior with flanking and creeping. Structures threatened. Evacuations, area, road and trail closures in effect. Twin Sisters, Washington State Fire Marshal's Office. Five miles south of Wallula, WA. Grass and brush. No new information."
    },
